# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Image plan for the Dialysis Nurse Assistant / Patient Care Assistant (PCA) subtrack (Renal Care Academy).

HEROES: one circular-vignette hero per page (williamriveromd-hero-vignette v3), 13 in all (course home + 12 modules;
the end-of-course check reuses the course-home hero). Module tile cards (640 x 360) and Related Guides thumbnails are cut
from the heroes; module share images are made from the heroes by patch_og_images.py.
FIGURES: in-body teaching figures. Scaffolds A-E follow williamriveromd-simple-figure v1 (A = clinical algorithm in the
williamriveromd-algorithm-generator-skill style), M = review-article mechanism figure (williamriveromd-biomedical-mechanism-
figure), S = organ crosstalk sigil (williamriveromd-organ-crosstalk-sigil-graphic), P = instructional photo strip
(williamriveromd-infographic-skill procedural style). A figure is placed at the end of its section only once
images/<stem>.webp (or .png) exists, so the pages never show a broken image.
OG / TILES: the track share-card art for build_academy_og.py, the calculator share card, and the Academy landing tile.
Each figure records its teaching purpose: Understand (the mechanism), Apply (the action), Appreciate (why it matters).
tools/dialysis_nurse_assistant/build_image_prompts.py turns this file into docs/dialysis-nurse-assistant/.
"""

